WEBVTT

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.934
Mado kara tobidashita no wa

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.743
Fukaku aoku hareteta kara

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:50.310
Mada mienai jibun ni

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:57.119
Tomadou kara hadashi
dekakenuketa yo

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:03.964
Umaku ienai umaku dekinai koto

00:01:03.964 --> 00:01:09.834
Muchu de niramitsuketa
kagami no mukou

00:01:10.871 --> 00:01:16.343
Kushakusha no yume wo
poketto ni tsumekonde

00:01:16.343 --> 00:01:23.484
Sora ni junengo no boku ni
mukete yakusoku shita

00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:29.056
Zutto shinjiteiru asu wa
machigai ja nai

00:01:29.056 --> 00:01:35.429
Kitto dare yori mo tsuyoi
omoi motteiru kara

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:39.661
Sotto

00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:13.332
Teary *
Did I See a Secret?!

00:02:44.498 --> 00:02:45.965
Hazuki Yazakura in Koyomi

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:50.370
Just being honest
isn't good enough

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:54.741
My heart absorbs it
and spits it back out

00:02:54.741 --> 00:03:00.180
My thoughts and writing will
reach you tomorrow

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.317
Cutting through the darkness

00:03:03.317 --> 00:03:05.953
Just being honest is
still only halfway...

00:03:05.953 --> 00:03:07.154
Super Tasty Water
Just being honest is
still only halfway...

00:03:07.154 --> 00:03:08.587
Super Tasty Water

00:07:10.964 --> 00:07:13.524
Hitotose

00:16:21.547 --> 00:16:22.605
B Class Senior,
Fumitsuki Nanakorobi

00:20:43.409 --> 00:20:49.649
The reason I jumped out the window

00:20:49.649 --> 00:20:53.745
Was because the deep
blue sky was so clear

00:20:55.988 --> 00:21:01.160
I was still uncertain about
the self I couldn't see

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:07.099
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:21:08.067 --> 00:21:13.773
There are things I can't
explain or do well

00:21:13.773 --> 00:21:17.470
That lie beyond the mirror that
I stare at so intently

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:26.152
So I put my rumpled-up
dream in my pocket

00:21:26.152 --> 00:21:33.259
And make a promise to myself
in the sky, ten years from now

00:21:33.259 --> 00:21:39.632
The future I've always
believed in is no mistake

00:21:39.632 --> 00:21:45.404
Because I'm sure I have stronger
feelings than anyone else

00:21:45.404 --> 00:21:50.740
Tenderly

00:22:23.843 --> 00:22:28.247
Hekotarerarenai shakariki ja nai

00:22:28.247 --> 00:22:31.684
Suteki na yume no machi Tokyo Life

00:22:31.684 --> 00:22:36.656
Naminami naranai
doryoku to kiseki de

00:22:36.656 --> 00:22:41.116
Barairo ni kagayaite shimaisou

00:22:42.995 --> 00:22:47.533
Junchou na Tokyo Days
akanuketa desho

00:22:47.533 --> 00:22:50.770
Hayari no fuku mo kenkyu shite

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:55.408
Ima ja kurabu mo kao pasu na no

00:22:55.408 --> 00:22:59.478
Mini sukato ga oki ni iri

00:22:59.478 --> 00:23:03.149
Yujoo no wa tte daiji dakara

00:23:03.149 --> 00:23:07.019
tozen desho keitai denwa

00:23:07.019 --> 00:23:14.694
Totemo hito ni wa ienai baito
ganbatte te ni ireta no

00:23:14.694 --> 00:23:18.764
Hekotarerarenai shakariki ja nai

00:23:18.764 --> 00:23:22.435
Suteki na yume no machi Tokyo Life

00:23:22.435 --> 00:23:24.603
Dou shitai wakaranai

00:23:24.603 --> 00:23:31.941
Kodoku na jijitsu ga poroporo to
nozokarete shimaisou

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:38.351
Nazeka yarusenai namida mo denai

00:23:38.351 --> 00:23:42.021
Suteki na yume no machi Tokyo Life

00:23:42.021 --> 00:23:46.892
Genki de imasu ka
natsukashii koe ni

00:23:46.892 --> 00:23:51.420
Ushirogami hikareteru kiga shimasu

00:23:55.935 --> 00:23:58.301
Happy Lesson TV is
finished broadcasting!

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:03.342
Thank you for watching
all the way to the end!

00:24:03.342 --> 00:24:04.977
It was fun!

00:24:04.977 --> 00:24:07.580
It's very sad that
the program is really over!

00:24:07.580 --> 00:24:09.648
It hope we can see
each other again sometime!

00:24:09.648 --> 00:24:11.183
Don't forget about us, everyone!

00:24:11.183 --> 00:24:12.151
Make sure to brush your teeth!

00:24:12.151 --> 00:24:12.952
This is hopeless.

00:24:12.952 --> 00:24:14.887
Well, before we leave, let me
give you a passionate kiss!

00:24:14.887 --> 00:24:16.188
Don't do that!

00:24:16.188 --> 00:24:17.189
All together now!

00:24:17.189 --> 00:24:18.591
Ready? Go!

00:24:18.591 --> 00:24:22.220
To all of you students,
bye-bye and kiss!
